 ## rates
 
 - `rates.quote(weight_kg, zone)`: price for a weight and zone
+
+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.escalate_invoice(invoice_id)`: set an open invoice to "escalated" so the collections team picks it up. Only open invoices of at least `ESCALATION_MIN_AMOUNT` (500.00 USD, see `parcelo/settings.py`) can be escalated.
+  - Returns: `Invoice` (not Money; the `amount` field is the invoice total)
+  - `raises E_NOT_FOUND if the invoice does not exist`
+  - `raises E_BAD_STATE if the invoice is paid or otherwise not open`
+  - `raises E_LIMIT if the invoice amount is below 500.00 USD`
+  - Emits `invoice.escalated` (only on the first escalation)
+  - Idempotent: yes. An invoice that is already escalated is returned unchanged, with no error and no second event.
+  - Not a list.
